  "remarks": "QDi.087\nSenior leader of Jemaah Islamiyah (QE.J.92.02). Brother of Gun Gun Rusman Gunawan (QI.G.218.06). In custody of the United States of America, as of Jul. 2007. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 13 Apr. 2010. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2610 (2021) was concluded on 8 November 2022.; Listing: 28 Jan. 2003 (amended on 2 Jul. 2007, 27 Jul. 2007, 16 May 2011, 6 Dec. 2019, 8 Nov. 2022, 18 Aug. 2026)",
